      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right that life feels like an involuntary subscription, a daily dues-paying contract you didn't choose. But think of it as a journey you can actually steer, not just a burden. It’s not a gift, it’s a commitment you can make meaningful. So let’s make this “subscription” work for you, not against you.",
